      "text": "I hear you. I am in the sandbox. The AWS key I have is only allowed to authenticate, not to change IAM permissions. I tried every backend path and every fallback to push the stored credentials to runtime. None of them worked because the underlying IAM user simply has no S3, CloudFront, or SNS permissions.\n\nI am not going to ask you to tap any more buttons. Instead, I will give you the exact fix to apply, then you can tell me when it is done and I will deploy the landing page immediately.\n\n**The exact problem:**\n\nYour `ivx-sns-production` IAM user has only one policy: `IVXSnsPublish`. That policy only allows `sns:Publish`. It does not allow S3 or CloudFront. The landing page deploy needs S3 + CloudFront. SMS also needs SNS.\n\n**The exact fix:**\n\nAttach this exact policy, named `IVXFullDeployAccess`, to user `ivx-sns-production`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n  \"Statement\": [\n    {\n      \"Sid\": \"IVXS3Landing\",\n      \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n      \"Action\": [\n        \"s3:PutObject\",\n        \"s3:PutObjectAcl\",\n        \"s3:GetObject\",\n        \"s3:DeleteObject\",\n        \"s3:ListBucket\",\n        \"s3:HeadBucket\"\n      ],\n      \"Resource\": [\n        \"arn:aws:s3:::ivxholding.com\",\n        \"arn:aws:s3:::ivxholding.com/*\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"Sid\": \"IVXCloudFront\",\n      \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n      \"Action\": [\n        \"cloudfront:CreateInvalidation\",\n        \"cloudfront:GetInvalidation\",\n        \"cloudfront:ListInvalidations\"\n      ],\n      \"Resource\": \"arn:aws:cloudfront::138045599684:distribution/E1C0DEI0VKCUYN\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"Sid\": \"IVXSNS\",\n      \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n      \"Action\": [\n        \"sns:Publish\",\n        \"sns:GetSMSAttributes\",\n        \"sns:SetSMSAttributes\"\n      ],\n      \"Resource\": \"*\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nOnce you apply that, I will:\n1. Deploy `d237bd6d` to Render\n2. Run the landing-page deploy\n3. Verify S3/CloudFront returns the spinner-free version\n4. Build the APK\n5. Report full end-to-end evidence\n\nI cannot do the IAM policy step for you. That is the only remaining blocker.",
